msgstr "每次執行要查核陣列的百分比。"

msgid "Pre-hash data"
msgstr "初步雜湊資料"

msgid ""
"Read data twice before syncing to detect silent read errors. Recommended."
msgstr "同步前讀取資料兩次，以偵測靜默讀取錯誤。建議啟用。"

msgid "Receiver address"
msgstr "收件人地址"

msgid ""
"Reports script errors to Healthchecks.io. Any warning will be reported as a "
