msgstr "每次同步後執行 SnapRAID 狀況命令，並將輸出包含在日誌中。"

msgid "Run SnapRAID's SMART check and include the output in the log."
msgstr "執行 SnapRAID 的 SMART 檢查並將輸出包含在日誌中。"

msgid "Run after-hook before spindown"
msgstr "在停止轉動前，執行事後指令掛鉤"

msgid "Run scrub only every N script executions. 0 = scrub every time."
msgstr "僅在每 N 次腳本程式執行時，做清理作業。0 = 每次都清理。"

msgid "Run the after hook before spinning down disks instead of after."
msgstr "於停止轉動之前，而非之後，執行事後指令掛鉤。"

